
<article class="weather-container prose">
<h1>About leahillwx.org</h1>

<p>Positioned on Lea Hill in Auburn, WA, this weather station is powered by an Ambient Weather WS-2902C. Data samples are taken every 5 seconds and published live to this site.</p>

<p>This station tracks the following weather measurements:</p>

<ul>
  <li>Temperature</li>
  <li>Humidity</li>
  <li>Barometric pressure</li>
  <li>Wind</li>
  <li>Direction</li>
  <li>Speed</li>
  <li>Rainfall</li>
  <li>UV</li>
</ul>

<p>Everything else is recorded and interpolated using software.</p>

